| `hm_phone` | text | Home phone |
| `wk_phone` | text | Work phone |
| `wireless_phone` | text | Mobile phone |
| `email` | text | Email address |
| `guarantor` | bigint | Guarantor PatNum |
| `pri_prov` | bigint | Primary provider number |
| `sec_prov` | bigint | Secondary provider number |
| `est_balance` | numeric(12,2) | Estimated balance |
| `bal_0_30` | numeric(12,2) | Balance 0-30 days |
| `bal_31_60` | numeric(12,2) | Balance 31-60 days |
| `bal_61_90` | numeric(12,2) | Balance 61-90 days |
| `bal_over_90` | numeric(12,2) | Balance over 90 days |
