### `v_clinic_patient_counts`

Returns patient count per clinic — useful for SaaS dashboard analytics.

```sql
select * from v_clinic_patient_counts;
-- Result:
-- clinic_code | clinic_name           | patient_count
-- CLINIC_A    | Clinic A - Downtown   | 15423
-- CLINIC_B    | Clinic B - Uptown     | 8721
-- CLINIC_C    | Clinic C - Suburb     | 342
```

### `v_clinic_activity`

Returns clinics ordered by most recent activity (sync or webhook).

```sql
select * from v_clinic_activity;
-- Result:
-- clinic_code | clinic_name           | is_active | last_sync_at          | last_webhook_at       | subscription_tier
-- CLINIC_A    | Clinic A - Downtown   | true      | 2026-08-02 02:00:00  | 2026-08-02 09:45:12  | enterprise
